  "description": {
    "en": "The Dunlop SX 300 TOUR 2025 is a competitive spin-focused racquet featuring a 98 sq.in head, 305 g unstrung weight and 315 mm head-light balance. SONIC CORE with Infinergy enhances rebound and vibration absorption, while SPIN BOOST XT GROMMETS and SPIN BOOST FRAME GEOMETRY increase spin potential and explosive shot production. V-ENERGY SHAFT improves stability and swing-through speed, while VIBROSHIELD helps reduce unwanted vibration for greater comfort and control.",

    "zh": "Dunlop SX 300 TOUR 2025 是一款面向高水平竞技球员的旋转型球拍，采用98平方英寸拍面、305克空拍重量及315毫米头轻平衡设计。SONIC CORE with Infinergy 提升回弹表现并吸收震动；SPIN BOOST XT GROMMETS 与 SPIN BOOST FRAME GEOMETRY 进一步增强旋转和爆发力；V-ENERGY SHAFT 提升稳定性与挥拍速度；VIBROSHIELD 则帮助降低震动，在高速对抗中提供更好的舒适性与控制。整体定位是旋转、控制与力量之间的高性能平衡，适合主动进攻型底线球员及比赛型选手。"
  },

